  /**
   * Half the view's width in world units, for an orthographic camera at a `zoom` of 1
   *
   * The height follows from the aspect ratio of the rect the image lands in.
   * @default 5
   * @example
   * ```ts
   * camera.orthographicSize = level.width / 2;
   * ```
   */
